3025-- Symptom: post generation validation fails despite acceptable pixels. Cause: validator-required evidence sections or their structured schema are missing (scorecard columns, instrument names, benchmark axes, coordinator fields). Fix: use the validator implementation and fixtures as the evidence schema before claiming completion; do not change pixels merely to repair report-format failures [Task 5]
3026-- Symptom: the full naming guard fails after the requested pack passes target checks. Cause: five unrelated starred PNG artifacts are pre-existing, and the target-specific invocation also flagged a free-form artifact-family concern. Fix: preserve unrelated artifacts, report the repository-wide blocker separately, and recheck canonical route-manifest/artifact-family identity before subsequent delivery [Task 5]
