## User preferences

- when the user corrected `manuscript_state: REVIEWABLE` to `NONE` -> require an actual openable `.tex` or `.pdf`, not metadata such as `PDF_PREFLIGHT.txt`, before calling a manuscript reviewable [Task 1]
- when the user identifies several truncated artifacts as one connector-channel failure -> report the systemic cause and recovery route through the original environment/normal `git push`, not three isolated artifact symptoms [Task 1]
